From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 17:12:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Build the outfit inspiration gallery
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Static gallery over data.json — no build step, no frameworks.

- data.json: metadata for all 25 photos in Images/, tagged by garment,
  colour, fit, season, occasion, style and keywords
- script.js: loads data.json once and filters in memory. The search index
  is built by walking each record recursively, so new attributes become
  searchable without code changes. Multi-word queries AND together,
  punctuation is ignored (tshirt matches T-shirt), and quoted phrases and
  field:value scoping are supported
- style.css: dark theme with a blue accent, responsive masonry that steps
  4/3/2/1 columns, and a lightbox that shrink-wraps to the photo
- Lightbox closes on backdrop click, Escape or the close button; arrow keys
  move through the current filter

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
